{"title":"TOPHATs Village Idiots and Rock Stars at the AGO","startsAt":"2026-10-07T18:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-07T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join Lawrence, your top hatted host for and evening of Beer and Free Entry to the AGO.\n\nOn Monday, get your FREE pass to the AGO by following this link.\n\nhttps://ago.ca/visit/free-wednesday-night\n\nAt 6 pm, we will Meet-up at the Village Idiot for our social. They have a great selection of import and craft beers. Lots of good local dishes to enjoy.\n\nAt 7 pmish, we will cross the street to the AGO to gain FREE entry. I recommend taking a screen shot of your pass on your phone to enable fast access.\n\nOur first exhibit will be\nMelissa Auf der Maur: My ‘90s Rock Photographs on\nhttps://ago.ca/exhibitions/melissa-auf-der-maur-my-90s-rock-photographs\n\nThen we will meander our way over to the The Marvin Gelber Print and Drawing Study Centre, where we will see prints, drawings and photographs.\n\nhttps://ago.ca/research/print-and-drawing-centre","venue":{"name":"Village Idiot Pub","address":"126 McCaul St M5T 1W2, Toronto","lat":43.654446,"lng":-79.39162,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Beer Lovers","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/5/2/6/highres_466718182.jpeg"}